{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to WobblePop, the bubbly underwater adventure full of fast-paced fun! Tap and pop colorful bubbles to score points, but watch out for the wiggly, mischievous fish trying to get in your way. With bright colors, cheerful sounds, and easy-to-use controls, WobblePop is perfect for anyone who loves fun challenges. How many bubbles can you pop before things get tricky? Dive in and find out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on 30 exciting challenge levels, each with unique obstacles and goals to test your bubble-popping skills. Along the way, you can unlock three adorable underwater buddies to help you out! A playful pufferfish will cheer you on, a speedy shrimp gives your game an extra boost, and a friendly shark helps keep pesky fish at bay. Unlock them all and enjoy even more bubbly fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready to pop, dodge, and splash your way to underwater glory in WobblePop!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3491710?t=1740808815","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3491710?t=1740808815","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491710/960f2ee67ea6c0d58b8c30cc6fb86c6fe016f9e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740808815","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491710/960f2ee67ea6c0d58b8c30cc6fb86c6fe016f9e2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740808815","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to WobblePop, the bubbly underwater adventure full of fast-paced fun! Tap and pop colorful bubbles to score points, but watch out for the wiggly, mischievous fish trying to get in your way. With bright colors, cheerful sounds, and easy-to-use controls, WobblePop is perfect for anyone who loves fun challenges. How many bubbles can you pop before things get tricky? Dive in and find out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on 30 exciting challenge levels, each with unique obstacles and goals to test your bubble-popping skills. Along the way, you can unlock three adorable underwater buddies to help you out! A playful pufferfish will cheer you on, a speedy shrimp gives your game an extra boost, and a friendly shark helps keep pesky fish at bay. Unlock them all and enjoy even more bubbly fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready to pop, dodge, and splash your way to underwater glory in WobblePop!</p>","developers":["Aio","Sara Solace"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491710/header.jpg?t=1740808815","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257100906,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100906/movie480.mp4?t=1740161381","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100906/movie_max.mp4?t=1740161381"},"name":"WobblePop Coming Soon","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257100906/583d40e7af096e9248da50c54243108ef193d623/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740161381","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100906/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1740161381","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100906/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1740161381"}}],"name":"WobblePop","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"WobblePop - $2.99 USD","packageid":1233106,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":2